OL,3,GNEWSAMajor works to improve journeys
OL,4,Athrough town
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads and footpaths in
OL,7,FBarton-upon-Humber are to be improved
OL,8,Fover the coming months in a major
OL,9,Fprogramme of works, the council has
OL,10,Fannounced.
OL,12,FNorth Lincolnshire Council said the
OL,13,Fupgrades to road junctions, walking and
OL,14,Fcycling connections and access to the
OL,15,Frailway station would make everyday
OL,16,Fjourneys easier and safer for
OL,17,Fresidents.
OL,19,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham said:
OL,20,F"Barton will be better connected,
OL,21,Feasier to get around and better
OL,22,Fprepared for the future."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
